    ∫⁻ x, ‖mconvE μ f x‖ₑ ≤ μ univ * ∫⁻ x, ‖f x‖ₑ

theorem lintegral_lintegral_sub_eqE (μ : Measure E) [SFinite μ] {g : E → ℝ≥0∞}
